{"name":"Perfect Days","hex":"#49a0e7","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"perfect","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Fitting its definition precisely.","Having all of its parts in harmony with a common purpose."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The perfect tense, or a form in that tense.","A perfect score; the achievement of finishing a stage or task with no mistakes."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/perfect"},{"term":"days","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of day"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A particular time or period of vague extent.","Life."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/days"}],"entries":[{"title":"Perfect Days","blocks":[{"text":"Perfect Days is a 2023 Japanese-language drama film directed by Wim Wenders from a script written by Wenders and Takuma Takasaki. A co-production between Japan and Germany, the film follows the routine life of Hirayama, a public toilet cleaner in Tokyo."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c9/Perfect_Days_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfect_Days","wikidata":"Q117663112"},{"title":"Day","blocks":[{"text":"A day is the time period of a full rotation of the Earth with respect to the Sun. On average, this is 24 hours. As a day passes at a given location it experiences morning, afternoon, evening, and night. This daily cycle drives circadian rhythms in many organisms, which are vital to many life processes."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Day","wikidata":"Q573"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Yoyohachi_2302d.jpg/500px-Yoyohachi_2302d.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Yoyohachi_2302d.jpg/500px-Yoyohachi_2302d.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm